# pycrate agrees with ours on every random value. asn1c and rasn apply a
# UTF8String's SIZE as PER-visible, a constrained length, where X.691 10.3.7
# and 30.6 make no constraint on it PER-visible (the length is unconstrained,
# in octets): the deviation tests/x691/README.md records for UNALIGNED, here in
# ALIGNED, on the type NGAP names use.
deviates asn1c Name
deviates asn1c Named
deviates rasn Name
deviates rasn Named
